AIOHD NEXT — licensing and attribution

This package contains an adapted MetrixHD skin. The original notice is retained
in root/usr/share/enigma2/AIOHD/skin.xml and applies to the inherited skin:

MetrixHD v2.5 by iMaxxx | optimized for openATV 4.0
Explicitly, no one is allowed to use any version of the Skin with other team Images
You can modify and redistribute it as long as you keep this license and the
original author for the skin and all of your modifications

AIOHD NEXT modifications: Paweł Pawełek.
No blanket MIT/GPL licence is asserted for third-party assets in this repository.
The included DejaVu font licence is in:
root/usr/share/enigma2/AIOHD/fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt
Optional plugins, system fonts and MetrixHD components retain their own licences.
Retain these notices when redistributing this repository or an IPK built from it.
